<%# page title: PreCheckd - Privacy Policy %>
<div class="legal-page">
  <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="updated-date">Last updated September 11, 2026</p>

  <div class="content-card">
    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>When you sign up as a recruiter on PreCheckd, we collect your name, corporate email address, phone number, company name, and — during identity verification — a government-issued ID image and a live selfie, processed through our verification partner, Stripe Identity.</p>

    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use your information solely to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Verify your identity, phone number, and company affiliation</li>
      <li>Create and display your public verified recruiter profile</li>
      <li>Send you SMS verification codes and important account communications</li>
      <li>Maintain the security and integrity of the PreCheckd platform</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Data We Do Not Share</h2>
    <p>Your personal data stays completely in-house. We never sell or share your information with any third party for marketing or promotional purposes, for any reason. Your email address and phone number are never displayed publicly on your profile.</p>

    <h2>4. SMS Communications</h2>
    <p>By providing your phone number, you consent to receive SMS verification messages from PreCheckd, powered by AWS Notify. AWS does not share your phone number with third parties for marketing or promotional purposes. Message and data rates may apply. Text HELP for help, or STOP to cancel. See our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a> for full SMS terms.</p>

    <h2>5. Third-Party Service Providers</h2>
    <p>We work with trusted third-party providers strictly to operate our service:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Stripe Identity</strong> — government ID and facial verification</li>
      <li><strong>AWS (Amazon Web Services)</strong> — SMS verification code delivery</li>
      <li><strong>MongoDB Atlas</strong> — secure database hosting</li>
    </ul>
    <p>These providers only receive the information necessary to perform their specific function and are contractually bound to protect your data.</p>

    <h2>6. Data Security</h2>
    <p>Your data is encrypted in transit and at rest. We use industry-standard security practices to protect your information from unauthorized access.</p>

    <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We retain your account information for as long as your profile remains active on PreCheckd. You may request deletion of your account and associated data at any time by emailing us.</p>

    <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information at any time by contacting us at <a href="mailto:privacy@precheckd.com">privacy@precheckd.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We encourage you to review this page periodically for the latest information on our privacy practices.</p>

    <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy? Email us at <a href="mailto:privacy@precheckd.com">privacy@precheckd.com</a>. See also our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>.</p>
  </div>
</div>
